reviewSummary:
Reviewed completion commit f69a494c (on moe/work-2026-10-24, pushed). Code +259/-10 in 4 files, under 400; diff --check clean; no fixtures/ path.
Gate: I re-ran task.verification in a git-archive snapshot of f69a494c (env -i, Node 24.21.0). Exit 0: 356 tests, 355 pass, 0 fail, 1 skip.
DoD1: met by CY2 (pass run, 3-run inputs), CY3 (18 rows plus a reject row) and CY4 (wiring; teardown still deletes certify's VM). Natively the canary matches the real runCheckJob:
- supervisorSha256 = sha256(supervisor), as bootstrap sets it;
- toolchainSha256 = the manifest pin;
